# Scratch image written by check-profile-verification.sh. It lives beside the
# script rather than in /tmp because Git Bash's curl is a Windows binary and
# cannot open a POSIX /tmp path. Removed on exit, but ignored so an interrupted
# run cannot leave it staged.
perimity-test-photo.*.png

